# Lean memory

- `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/rules/` stay small: map, gates, one-line pointers.
- Ticket history, playbooks, sharp edges live under `data/changes/` — read on demand, never paste into always-on files.
- One canonical ledger per fact (write-once). Rules point; they do not duplicate.
